flowchart TB
    subgraph clients[Clients and External Systems]
        web[Angular Web UI]
        external[External Query Consumer]
        cis[Cloud Identity Service]
        cms[Channel Management System]
    end

    subgraph hps[Hotel Pricing System]
        edge[API Edge]
        auth[Identity and Authorization Integration]
        pricing[Pricing Service]
        query[Query Service]
        adminsvc[Hotel and Rate Administration Service]
        usersvc[User Access Administration Service]
        pub[Publication and Integration Service]
        kafka[Kafka / Event Backbone]

        pstore[(Pricing Data Store)]
        qstore[(Query Read Store)]
        astore[(Administration Data Store)]
        ustore[(Authorization / Permissions Store)]
    end

    web -->|HTTPS/REST| edge
    external -->|HTTPS/REST| edge

    edge -->|Auth requests / token validation| auth
    auth -->|Authenticate / identity info| cis

    edge -->|Change prices / simulate| pricing
    edge -->|Query prices| query
    edge -->|Manage hotels/rates| adminsvc
    edge -->|Manage users| usersvc

    pricing -->|Authorization check| auth
    query -->|Authorization check| auth
    adminsvc -->|Authorization check| auth
    usersvc -->|Authorization check| auth

    pricing --> pstore
    query --> qstore
    adminsvc --> astore
    usersvc --> ustore

    pricing -->|Publish pricing events| kafka
    kafka -->|Consume events| pub
    pub -->|Push updated prices via REST| cms